{"2779620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Adrian's Quest", "steam_appid": 2779620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adrian's Quest is a single-player VR action-adventure game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embody an android from the A.D.R.I.A.N. class, stranded on an alien world that has been largely abandoned. Caught in the crossfire of four rivaling factions, each fighting for control, you must traverse a haunting mix of alien wilderness, outdated industrial zones, and forgotten remnants of civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge variety of explorable environments – both indoor and outdoor – set in a fantastic alien world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world filled with all kinds of monsters, notorious enemies, and nasty bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different machines, puzzles, and game mechanics that make Adrian’s Quest <i>the</i> VR game the community deserves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully interactive playground – use, move, throw, or destroy almost everything you see.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running, climbing, pushing, throwing – Adrian’s Quest is a fully physical VR experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavy gunfights with bizarre weapons, throwable objects, and tons of destruction. This game means action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adrian's Quest is a single-player VR action-adventure game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embody an android from the A.D.R.I.A.N. class, stranded on an alien world that has been largely abandoned. Caught in the crossfire of four rivaling factions, each fighting for control, you must traverse a haunting mix of alien wilderness, outdated industrial zones, and forgotten remnants of civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge variety of explorable environments – both indoor and outdoor – set in a fantastic alien world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world filled with all kinds of monsters, notorious enemies, and nasty bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different machines, puzzles, and game mechanics that make Adrian’s Quest <i>the</i> VR game the community deserves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully interactive playground – use, move, throw, or destroy almost everything you see.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running, climbing, pushing, throwing – Adrian’s Quest is a fully physical VR experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavy gunfights with bizarre weapons, throwable objects, and tons of destruction. This game means action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Adrian's Quest is a single-player VR action-adventure game filled with physics-based puzzles and bizarre gunfights, set on a dusty, run-down alien planet home to strange creatures and a declining population.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779620/c5703b504175c6d5696dc4c8248c280481c059b4/header.jpg?t=1786869907", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779620/ca641a8c8086ed3dc0d1b05d07e6eba63e269d19/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786869907", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779620/ca641a8c8086ed3dc0d1b05d07e6eba63e269d19/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786869907", "website": nul